   "sentenceId": 7,
   "he": "אִשָּׁה פְּרוּשָׁה וְכוּ׳. תָּנוּ רַבָּנַן: בְּתוּלָה צַלְיָינִית, וְאַלְמָנָה שׁוֹבָבִית, וְקָטָן שֶׁלֹּא כָּלוּ לוֹ חֳדָשָׁיו — הֲרֵי אֵלּוּ מְבַלֵּי עוֹלָם.",
   "en": "§ The mishna states that «an abstinent woman» is among those who erode the world. «The Sages taught: A maiden who prays» constantly, «and a neighborly [shovavit] widow» who constantly visits her neighbors, «and a child whose months» of gestation «were not completed,» all «these are» people «who erode the world.»"
  }
